#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Chemical Cooking"
msgstr "Gotowanie chemikaliów"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chemical Cooking" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you produced illicit chemicals for your own consumption, or to sell "
"to others.  Or maybe you're just a real nerd about chemistry.  In any case, "
"you know your way around a Periodic Table."
msgstr ""
"Być może produkowałeś nielegalne chemikalia na własne potrzeby lub na "
"sprzedaż innym. A może po prostu jesteś prawdziwym kujonem w dziedzinie "
"chemii. W każdym razie, znasz się na Tablicy Mendelejewa."

#. ~ Profession name for female
