#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Video Gaming"
msgstr "Gracz wideo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Video Gaming" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You loved immersing yourself in virtual worlds through video games.  Now "
"you're faced with real survival horror, and no extra lives."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiałeś zanurzać się w wirtualnych światach dzięki grom wideo. Teraz "
"czeka cię prawdziwy survival horror, i to bez dodatkowych żyć."

