#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Vegetarian Foraging"
msgstr "Wegetariańskie zbieractwo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Vegetarian Foraging" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have been a vegetarian for so long that eating meat makes you feel sick."
"  You like to supplement your diet with wild plants and mushrooms foraged in"
" the woods."
msgstr ""
"Od tak dawna jesteś wegetarianinem, że jedzenie mięsa przyprawia cię o "
"mdłości. Lubisz uzupełniać swoją dietę o dzikie rośliny i grzyby zbierane w "
"lesie."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Vegetarian Foraging"
msgstr "Wegetariańskie zbieractwo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Vegetarian Foraging" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
