msgid "Practical Jokes"
msgstr "Żartowniś"

#. ~ Description of profession "Practical Jokes" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Pranks and physical jokes are a passion of yours, from the setup right "
