msgid "Moshing"
msgstr "Moshing"

#. ~ Description of profession "Moshing" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went to loud concerts and spent your time in the mosh pits.  Now that "
"everything's gone to hell, the whole world is your mosh pit."
msgstr ""
"Chodziłeś na głośne koncerty i spędzałeś czas w mosh pitach. Teraz, kiedy "
"wszystko poszło w diabły, cały świat jest twoim mosh pitem."

