#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "Kowal"

#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of"
" some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Wpadłeś w kłopoty po zakończeniu zajęć z metalurgii w lokalnym technikum, "
"ale pomimo spustoszenia udało ci się zachować nieco sprzętu, który miałeś ze"
" sobą."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "Kowalka"

#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
