"zrobili."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Otaku"

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Po wielu późnych nocach spędzonych z kolegami na oglądaniu anime i jedzeniu "
"przekąsek, postanowiłeś udać się na główny konwent anime na Północnym "
"Wschodzie. Teraz zombie pożerają wszystkich, a co gorsza konwent odwołano. "
"Na szczęście byłeś gotowy na podarcie kostiumu."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Otaku"

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Po wielu późnych nocach spędzonych z koleżankami na oglądaniu anime i "
"jedzeniu przekąsek, postanowiłaś udać się na główny konwent anime na "
"Północnym Wschodzie. Teraz zombie pożerają wszystkich, a co gorsza konwent "
"odwołano. Na szczęście byłaś gotowa na podarcie kostiumu."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Groom"
msgstr "Pan młody"

#. ~ Description of profession "Groom" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm struck on the big day and you escaped with nothing but your "
"wedding attire.  Cold feet?  You'd just like to keep your feet attached!"
msgstr ""
"Kataklizm wydarzył się w twój wielki dzień i uciekłeś tyko w ślubnym stroju."
" Efekt „zimnych stóp”? Przynajmniej masz te stopy razem ze sobą!"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bride"
msgstr "Panna młoda"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bride" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
