"uciszyć. I co teraz jasne jak słońce - a nie mówiłam?"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rat Prince"
msgstr "Szczurzy książę"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Prince" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least"
" your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Prawdopodobnie potrzebna ci była pomoc psychiatryczna a nie odsiadka za "
"kratkami. Przynajmniej twoi lojalni słudzy trzymają fason gdy dokonujesz "
"swej wielkiej ucieczki."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rat Princess"
msgstr "Szczurza księżniczka"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Princess" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
