"jeśli wszyscy w mieście są nieumarli?"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lawyer"
msgstr "Prawnik"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat"
" your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Miałeś ławę przysięgłych w garści, ale po tym jak pozwany chciał zejść ci "
"mózg, musiałeś haniebnie uciekać z sali sądowej. Nikt nie reagował na twoje "
"sprzeciwy."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lawyer"
msgstr "Prawniczka"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
