#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dodgeball Player"
msgstr "Zawodnik w dwa ognie"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dodgeball Player" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In dodgeball, failing to dodge meant taking a ball to the head and being out"
" of the game.  In the Cataclysm, it means getting eaten by monsters.  Don't "
"slip up."
msgstr ""
"W dwóch ogniach jak się nie uchylisz to dostajesz piłką w łeb i wypadasz z "
"gry. W Kataklizmie to znaczy bycie zjedzonym przez potwory. Lepiej się wiec "
"nie pośliznąć."

