"czasach, gdy każdy chce mieć kawałek ciebie."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "Opiekun zoo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some"
" reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś wezwany jak miałeś dzień wolny by nakarmić zwierzęta w zoo. Z jakiegoś"
" powodu żaden z twoich współpracowników nie pojawił się dziś w pracy."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "Opiekunka zoo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
