#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Roadie"
msgstr "Roadie"

#. ~ Description of profession "Roadie" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always worked just outside of the limelight, carrying and fixing the "
"equipment and ensuring that the performers got what they needed.  The show "
"must go on."
msgstr ""
"Zawsze pracowałeś poza centrum uwagi, niosąc i naprawiając sprzęt i "
"upewniając się, że wykonawcy dostali to, czego potrzebowali. Przedstawienie "
"musi trwać."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Roadie"
msgstr "Roadie"

#. ~ Description of profession "Roadie" for female
