#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Captain"
msgstr "Kapitan"

#. ~ Description of profession "Captain" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the captain of your small ship, making a living by driving divers "
"and tourists around the sea.  The last excursion went wrong after your "
"passengers tried a mutiny, but you managed to escape with your precious ship"
" intact."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś kapitanem swojego małego statku i zarabiałeś na życie, wożąc nurków i "
"turystów po morzu. Ostatnia wycieczka nie doszła do skutku, gdy pasażerowie "
"próbowali się zbuntować, ale udało ci się uciec z cennym statkiem w "
"nienaruszonym stanie."

