#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "dirt floor, overhead light"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "reinforced concrete floor"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "fractured concrete floor"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "half-built reinforced concrete floor"
