msgid "brush."
msgstr "szelest."

#. ~ Description of terrain "underbrush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"Small plants and shrubs that decorate the forest.  It has been rummaged "
"through and doesn't have anything useful left to forage from it."
msgstr ""
"Małe rośliny i krzewy, które zdobią las. Zostały one przeczesane i nie ma w "
"nich nic przydatnego do znalezienia."

#. ~ Description of terrain "underbrush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"Small plants and shrubs that decorate the forest.  It has been rummaged "
"through and doesn't have anything useful left to forage from it.  Frost "
"covers it."
msgstr ""
"Małe rośliny i krzewy, które zdobią las. Zostały one przeczesane i nie ma w "
"nich nic przydatnego do znalezienia. Pokrywa je szron."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "shrub"
msgstr "krzaki"

#. ~ Description of terrain "shrub"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small shrub."
msgstr "Mały krzew."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "peanut bush"
msgstr "orzacha podziemna"

#. ~ Description of terrain "peanut bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small bush of crunchy peanuts."
msgstr "Mały krzak z kłączami pełnymi chrupiących orzeszków ziemnych."

#. ~ Description of terrain "peanut bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small peanut bush that's fruitless."
msgstr "Mały krzak orzeszków ziemnych, który nie ma owoców."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "blueberry bush"
msgstr "krzak borówek"

#. ~ Description of terrain "blueberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small bush of sweet blueberries."
msgstr "Mały krzak słodkich jagód."

#. ~ Description of terrain "blueberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small blueberry bush that's fruitless."
msgstr "Mały krzak borówek, bez owoców."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "strawberry bush"
msgstr "krzew truskawek"

#. ~ Description of terrain "strawberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small bush of juicy strawberries."
msgstr "Mały krzak soczystych truskawek."

#. ~ Description of terrain "strawberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small strawberry bush that's fruitless."
msgstr "Mały krzak truskawek, bez owoców."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "blackberry bush"
msgstr "krzak jeżyn"

#. ~ Description of terrain "blackberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small bush of delicious blackberries.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr "Mały krzak smacznych jeżyn. Uwaga na kolce!"

#. ~ Description of terrain "blackberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small blackberry bush that's fruitless.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr "Mały krzak jeżyn, bez owoców. Uwaga na kolce!"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "huckleberry bush"
msgstr "borówka amerykańska"

#. ~ Description of terrain "huckleberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small bush of huckleberries, often mistaken as blueberries."
msgstr "Mały krzak borówki amerykańskiej mylonej czasem z jagodami."

#. ~ Description of terrain "huckleberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small huckleberry bush that's fruitless."
msgstr "Mały krzak borówki amerykańskiej, bez owoców."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "raspberry bush"
msgstr "malina"

#. ~ Description of terrain "raspberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small bush of delicious raspberries.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr "Mały krzak smacznych malin. Uwaga na kolce!"

#. ~ Description of terrain "raspberry bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small raspberry bush that's fruitless.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr "Mały krzak malin, bez owoców. Uwaga na kolce!"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "grape bush"
msgstr "krzew winogron"

#. ~ Description of terrain "grape bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A bush of a different species invaded by vines of grapes."
msgstr "Krzew innego gatunku obrośnięty pnączem winogron."

#. ~ Description of terrain "grape bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A bush of a different species invaded by grape vines but they're fruitless."
msgstr ""
"Krzew innego gatunku obrośnięty pnączem winogron, lecz nie ma tu owoców."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "rose bush"
msgstr "róża"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rose bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A fat bush of beautiful red roses, if only you could get a date!  Watch out "
"for its thorns!"
msgstr ""
"Okrągły krzew ślicznych czerwonych róż; świetnych na randkę gdybyś ją miał "
"mieć. Uwaga na kolce!"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rose bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A fat rose bush that currently has no blooms.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr "Okrągły krzew róż, obecnie bez kwiatów. Uwaga na kolce!"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "hydrangea bush"
msgstr "hortensja"

#. ~ Description of terrain "hydrangea bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A dense bush of fragrant blue hydrangeas."
msgstr "Gęsty krzew pachnących niebieskich hortensji."

#. ~ Description of terrain "hydrangea bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A fat hydrangea bush that currently has no blooms."
msgstr "Okrągły krzew hortensji, obecnie bez kwiatów."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "lilac bush"
msgstr "bez"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lilac bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A wide bush of bright pinkish purple lilacs."
msgstr "Szeroki krzew jasnoróżowo-purpurowych lilaków."

#. ~ Description of terrain "lilac bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A wide lilac bush that currently has no blooms."
msgstr "Rozłożysty krzew bzu, który obecnie nie kwitnie."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "tree trunk"
msgstr "pień drzewa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tree trunk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A section of trunk from a tree that has been cut down.  Can be sawn into "
"logs with the right tool."
msgstr ""
"Część pnia drzewa, które zostało ścięte. Przy pomocy odpowiedniego narzędzia"
" może być pocięty na kłody."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "tree stump"
msgstr "pień drzewa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tree stump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A tree stump, remnant of a tree that has been cut down."
msgstr "Pień, pozostałość po ściętym drzewie."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "woodchips"
msgstr "trociny"

#. ~ Description of terrain "woodchips"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"Small splinters of wood laid out in a layer to prevent unwanted plants from "
"growing."
msgstr ""
"Warstwa małych ścinków drewna wysypanych by zapobiec wzrostowi niechcianych "
"roślin."

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "grass"
msgid_plural "grasses"
msgstr[0] "trawa"
msgstr[1] "trawy"
msgstr[2] "traw"
msgstr[3] "trawy"

#. ~ Description of terrain "grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"An area of hardy Kentucky bluegrass about ankle high.  Cutting the grass "
"short enough would destroy the root system, causing this area to turn into a"
" patch of dirt."
msgstr ""
"Obszar twardej wiechliny łąkowej z Kentucky rosnącej do wysokości kostki. "
"Wycięcie tej trawy na krótko zniszczy system korzeniowy zostawiając połeć "
"gołej ziemi."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "white grass"
msgstr "biała trawa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "white grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A section of Kentucky bluegrass covered in white latex-based paint, with "
"neat lines designed for recreational sports."
msgstr ""
"Połeć łąki pokryta białą lateksową farbą wyznaczającą linie na potrzeby "
"sportowe."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "long grass"
msgstr "długa trawa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "long grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Long shaggy grass about shin high."
msgstr "Długa krzaczasta trawa sięgająca po goleń."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "tall grass"
msgstr "wysoka trawa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tall grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Tall grass about head high."
msgstr "Wysoka trawa sięgająca głowy."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "dead grass"
msgstr "martwa trawa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dead grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Long shaggy grass that hasn't been cut recently."
msgstr "Długa krzaczasta trawa, która została niedawno ścięta."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "golf green"
msgstr "darń golfowa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "golf green"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Grass mowed very short and neat."
msgstr "Krótko skoszona i wygładzona trawa."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "alien grass"
msgstr "obca trawa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like grass.  The blades are serrated "
"and move on their own."
msgstr ""
"Obszar czegoś co wygląda prawie jak trawa. Źdźbła są ząbkowane i poruszają "
"się samodzielnie."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "golf hole"
msgstr "otwór golfowy"

#. ~ Description of terrain "golf hole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small plastic cup embedded in the grass."
msgstr "Mały plastikowy kubek wmontowany w darń."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "young bamboo shoots"
msgstr "młode pędy bambusa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "young bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"An area of young bamboo shoots about ankle high.  Many shoots are just "
"barely pushing above the ground."
msgstr ""
"Obszar z młodymi pędami bambusa o wysokości około kostki. Wiele pędów ledwo "
"wystaje ponad ziemię."

#. ~ Description of terrain "young bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"An area of young bamboo shoots about ankle high.  The smallest shoots have "
"already been harvested."
msgstr ""
"Obszar z młodymi pędami bambusa o wysokości około kostki. Najmniejsze pędy "
"zostały już zebrane."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "long bamboo shoots"
msgstr "długie pędy bambusa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "long bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Long bamboo shoots about shin high."
msgstr "Długie pędy bambusa sięgające mniej-więcej do goleni."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "tall bamboo"
msgstr "wysoki bambus"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tall bamboo"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Tall bamboo thicket about head high."
msgstr "Wysoki gąszcz bambusów sięgające mniej-więcej do głowy."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "dead bamboo"
msgstr "martwy bambus"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dead bamboo"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Long brown dead bamboo shoots covered in white fungus."
msgstr "Długie, brązowe, martwe pędy bambusa pokryte białym grzybem."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "fern"
msgstr "paproć"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fern"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A short plant with thousands of leaves which grow in a fractal pattern from "
"the stem."
msgstr ""
"Krótka roślina z tysiącami liści, które wyrastają w fraktalny wzór z łodygi."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fern"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A short plant with thousands leaves which grow in a fractal pattern, without"
" any curled shoots."
msgstr ""
"Krótka roślina z tysiącami liści, które rosną we fraktalnym wzorze, bez "
"żadnych poskręcanych pędów."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "Marloss bush"
msgstr "krzak Marloss"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Marloss bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This alien plant superficially resembles a blueberry bush, and hangs with "
"large, juicy pink pomes that emit a heady, fruity aroma."
msgstr ""
"Ta obca roślina powierzchownie przypomina krzew borówki amerykańskiej i "
"obwieszona jest dużymi, soczystymi, różowymi owocami, które wydzielają "
"mocny, owocowy aromat."

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "Marloss bush"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "fungal wall"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "fungal mound"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "fungal shrub"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "fungal tree"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "young fungal tree"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "Marloss tree"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "branches with leaves"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "underground fungus"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid "poof!"
msgstr "poof!"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "fungal bed"
msgstr "grzybiczne podloże"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "Fungus grows thick here, obscuring the ground beneath it."
msgstr "Grzybnia porasta tu gęsto, przesłaniając ziemię pod sobą."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "fungal floor"
msgstr "grzybiczna podłoga"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid ""
"Grayish mold coats both the floor and the roof here, silent and still.  "
"Stray spores waft through the air."
msgstr ""
"Szarawa pleśń pokrywa zarówno podłogę, jak i dach, rosnąc tutaj cicho i "
"spokojnie. W powietrzu unoszą się strzępki zarodników."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "Grayish mold coats the floor here, silent and still."
msgstr "Szarawa pleśń pokrywa podłogę, rosnąc tutaj cicho i spokojnie."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "Grayish mold coats the ground here, silent and still."
msgstr "Szarawa pleśń pokrywa ziemię, rosnąc tutaj cicho i spokojnie."

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "fungal wall"
msgid_plural "fungal walls"
msgstr[0] "grzybiczna ściana"
msgstr[1] "grzybiczne ściany"
msgstr[2] "grzybicznych ścian"
msgstr[3] "grzybicznej ściany"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid ""
"Several thick, large tendrils of fungus perforate the wall here, piercing "
"straight through it from the outside.  Despite the apparent damage, the wall"
" is still structurally sound."
msgstr ""
"Kilka grubych, dużych wici grzyba przedziurawiło ścianę w tym miejscu, "
"przebijając się przez nią od zewnątrz. Pomimo widocznych uszkodzeń, ściana "
"jest nadal strukturalnie stabilna."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid ""
"The fungus here has grown thickly and tightly enough to form a solid wall.  "
"It feels very stiff to the touch, and seems to be very strong."
msgstr ""
"Tutejszy grzyb rozrósł się na tyle gęsto i ciasno, że tworzy solidną ścianę."
" W dotyku jest bardzo sztywny i wydaje się być bardzo mocny."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "fungal mound"
msgstr "grzybiczna sterta"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal mound"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "A mound of fungal matter, intertwined in itself."
msgstr "Kopiec materii grzybowej, spleciony sam w sobie."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "fungal shrub"
msgstr "grzybiczny krzew"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal shrub"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid ""
"This shrub has been completely absorbed by the mushrooms.  Its branches "
"droop and have lost much of their structure, and its leaves have vanished, "
"replaced by fleshy gray sacks that visibly expand and contract."
msgstr ""
"Ten krzew został całkowicie wchłonięty przez grzyby. Jego gałęzie opadły i "
"straciły wiele ze swojej struktury, a liście zniknęły, zastąpione przez "
"mięsiste szare worki, które zauważalnie rozszerzają się i kurczą."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "fungal tree"
msgstr "grzybiczne drzewo"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid ""
"Once tall and majestic, this tree is now a slave to the fungus like the "
"landscape around it.  Its bark is penetrated by and covered with fungal "
"tendrils, and the canopy has rotted away, leaving only the branches, "
"stretching forlornly to the sky as if to escape the infection overrunning "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Kiedyś wysokie i majestatyczne, to drzewo jest teraz niewolnikiem grzyba, "
"podobnie jak otaczający go krajobraz. Jego kora jest penetrowana i pokryta "
"wąsami grzybowymi, a baldachim zgnił, pozostawiając tylko gałęzie, "
"rozciągając się ku niebu, jakby chcąc uciec od zarażającej go infekcji."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "young fungal tree"
msgstr "młode grzybiczne drzewo"

#. ~ Description of terrain "young fungal tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "A small sapling poking through the ground, infested by fungal mold."
msgstr "Małe drzewko wystające z ziemi, porażone pleśnią grzybową."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "Marloss tree"
msgstr "drzewo Marloss"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Marloss tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This tree stands as a stark outlier to the landscape around it.  Despite its"
" infestation, its leaves wave proudly in the wind, colored pinkish-white.  "
"Its branches are heavy with pink fruit that looks both mutated and "
"delicious."
msgstr ""
"To drzewo wyróżnia się na tle otaczającego go krajobrazu. Pomimo porażenia, "
"jego liście dumnie falują na wietrze, zabarwione na różowo-biało. Jego "
"gałęzie są ciężkie od różowych owoców, które wyglądają zarówno na zmutowane,"
" jak i smakowite."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "shallow water"
msgstr "płytka woda"

#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Woda nie jest tu zbyt głęboka. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można by zebrać "
"stąd świeżą wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia bez przygotowania."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "deep water"
msgstr "głęboka woda"

#. ~ Description of terrain "deep water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You're having trouble seeing the bottom through the deep water here.  With a"
" watertight container, you could gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to "
"drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Masz problem z zobaczeniem dna w tej głębokiej wodzie. Mając wodoszczelny "
"pojemnik, można by zebrać stąd świeżą wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia bez"
" przygotowania."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "murky shallow water"
msgstr "mętna płytka woda"

#. ~ Description of terrain "murky shallow water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here but is murky with organic matter.  With a "
"watertight container, you could gather fetid water from here.  Not safe to "
"drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Woda nie jest tu zbyt głęboka, ale zamulona substancjami organicznymi. Przy "
"użyciu wodoszczelnego pojemnika można stąd czerpać mętną wodę. Nie jest "
"bezpieczna do picia w takiej postaci."

#. ~ Description of terrain "murky shallow water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here but it is murky with organic matter.  With a "
"watertight container, you could gather fetid water from here.  Not safe to "
"drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Woda nie jest tu zbyt głęboka, ale zamulona substancjami organicznymi. Przy "
"użyciu wodoszczelnego pojemnika można stąd czerpać mętną wodę. Nie jest "
"bezpieczna do picia w takiej postaci."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "flowing shallow water"
msgstr "płynąca płytka woda"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flowing shallow water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The streaming water isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you "
"could gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is, although "
"probably safer than stagnant water."
msgstr ""
"Płynąca woda nie jest tu zbyt głęboka. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, możesz "
"zebrać stąd świeżą wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia od ręki, ale "
"prawdopodobnie jest bezpieczniejsza niż woda stojąca."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "flowing deep water"
msgstr "płynąca głęboka woda"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flowing deep water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The streaming water looks deep here.  With a watertight container, you could"
" gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is, although probably "
"safer than stagnant water."
msgstr ""
"Płynąca woda wygląda tu na głęboką. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można by "
"zebrać stąd świeżą wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia od ręki, ale "
"prawdopodobnie jest bezpieczniejsza niż woda stojąca."

#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather salt water from here."
msgstr ""
"Woda nie jest tu zbyt głęboka. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można by zebrać "
"stąd słoną wodę."

#. ~ Description of terrain "deep water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You're having trouble seeing the bottom through the deep water here.  With a"
" watertight container, you could gather salt water from here."
msgstr ""
"Masz problem z zobaczeniem dna w tej głębokiej wodzie. Mając wodoszczelny "
"pojemnik, można by zebrać stąd słoną wodę."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "pool water"
msgstr "woda w basenie"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pool water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"A deep pool full of water.  Never swim without a lifeguard present.  Even "
"though monsters probably ate them."
msgstr ""
"Głęboki basen pełen wody. Nigdy nie pływaj bez obecności ratownika. Nawet "
"jeśli prawdopodobnie zjadły ich potwory."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "shallow pool water"
msgstr "płytki zbiornik wodny"

#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow pool water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "A shallow pool of water."
msgstr "Płytki zbiornik wodny."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "sewage"
msgstr "ściek"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sewage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"Gross.  Sewage water flows through here.  As if it needed saying, this isn't"
" safe to drink."
msgstr ""
"Ohyda. Płyną tędy ścieki. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia, na wypadek gdyby "
"trzeba było to podkreślić."

#. ~ Description of terrain "lava"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"An extremely hot, glowing liquid, composed of molten rock and/or metal.  In "
"some places, lava-grilled steak is a delicacy."
msgstr ""
"Niezwykle gorąca, żarząca się ciecz, składająca się ze stopionej skały i/lub"
" metalu. W niektórych miejscach grillowany na lawie stek jest przysmakiem."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "submersed water"
msgstr "głębia wody"

#. ~ Description of terrain "submersed water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are submerged below the surface of the water, your feet can't touch the "
"ground.  With a watertight container, you could gather fresh water from "
"here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś zanurzony pod powierzchnią wody, twoje stopy nie mogą dotknąć ziemi. "
"Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można by zebrać stąd świeżą wodę. W obecnej "
"postaci nie jest bezpieczna do picia."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "lake bed"
msgstr "dno jeziora"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lake bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of fresh water.  With a watertight "
"container, you could gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Stoisz na dnie zbiornika słodkiej wody. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można "
"by zebrać stąd słodką wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia w takiej postaci."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "ocean bed"
msgstr "dno oceanu"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ocean bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of salt water.  With a watertight "
"container, you could gather salt water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Stoisz na dnie zbiornika słonej wody. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można by "
"zebrać stąd słoną wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia w takiej postaci."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "bulkhead"
msgstr "gródź"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bulkhead"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The top of a submerged structure.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Szczyt zanurzonej konstrukcji. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można stąd "
"czerpać słodką wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia w takiej postaci."

#. ~ Description of terrain "bulkhead"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "The bottom of a submerged structure."
msgstr "Spód zanurzonej struktury."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "submerged concrete"
msgstr "podwodna płyta betonowa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "submerged concrete"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of fresh water on a pad of "
"concrete.  With a watertight container, you could gather fresh water from "
"here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Stoisz na dnie zbiornika słodkiej wody, na betonowej płycie. Mając "
"wodoszczelny pojemnik, można by zbierać stąd słodką wodę. Nie jest "
"bezpieczna do picia w takiej postaci."

#. ~ Description of terrain "submerged concrete"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of fresh water on a pad of yellow-"
"painted concrete.  With a watertight container, you could gather fresh water"
" from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Stoisz na dnie zbiornika słodkiej wody, na płycie pomalowanego na żółto "
"betonu. Mając wodoszczelny pojemnik, można by zbierać stąd słodką wodę. Nie "
"jest bezpieczna do picia w takiej postaci."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "hot spring water"
msgstr "gorąca woda źródlana"

#. ~ Description of terrain "hot spring water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"Scalding hot water, not particularly safe for swimming.  With a watertight "
"container, you could gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""
"Parząca, gorąca woda, niezbyt bezpieczna do kąpieli. Mając wodoszczelny "
"pojemnik, można stąd czerpać słodką wodę. Nie jest bezpieczna do picia w "
"takiej postaci."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "recess"
msgstr "zagłębienie"

#. ~ Description of terrain "recess"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "A shallow pit in the ground."
msgstr "Płytkie zagłębienie w ziemi."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "metal compactor"
msgstr "zgniatarka metali"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal compactor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A hydraulic machine for squeezing scrap into more compact chunks.  Useless "
"now that there's no power."
msgstr ""
"Hydrauliczna maszyna do ściskania złomu na bardziej kompaktowe kawałki. "
"Bezużyteczna teraz, gdy nie ma prądu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "gasoline pump"
msgstr "dystrybutor benzyny"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gasoline pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Precious GASOLINE.  The former world bowed to their petroleum god as it led "
"them to their ruin.  There's plenty left over to fuel your inner road "
"warrior.  If this gas dispenser doesn't give up the goods for free, you may "
"have to pay at a nearby terminal."
msgstr ""
"Drogocenna BENZYNA. Dawny świat kłaniał się swojemu naftowemu bogu, który "
"doprowadził go do ruiny. Zostało jeszcze sporo, by zasilić twojego "
"wewnętrznego wojownika szos. Jeśli ten dystrybutor nie wyda ci towaru za "
"darmo, być może będziesz musiał zapłacić na pobliskim terminalu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "smashed gas pump"
msgstr "rozbity dystrybutor benzyny"

#. ~ Description of terrain "smashed gas pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"The horror!  This gasoline pump has been destroyed, denying you access to "
"the liquid gold."
msgstr ""
"Horror! Ta pompa benzynowa została zniszczona, uniemożliwiając Ci dostęp do "
"płynnego złota."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "diesel pump"
msgstr "pompa diesla"

#. ~ Description of terrain "diesel pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This is a diesel fuel pump.  This roadside attraction provides all the "
"thick, gloopy liquid POWER you need to move your sensibly oversized "
"APOCALYPTIC SUPERTRUCK from point A to points beyond.  If it doesn't "
"dispense fuel immediately, try banging on it or grunt your way over the "
"nearby payment terminal."
msgstr ""
"To jest pompa do oleju napędowego. Ta przydrożna atrakcja dostarcza całą "
"gęstą, lepką, płynną MOC, której potrzebujesz, aby przemieścić swój "
"rozsądnie przerośnięty APOKALIPTYCZNY SUPER-WÓZ z punktu A do punktów gdzieś"
" dalej. Jeśli pompa nie wyda paliwa od ręki, spróbuj w nią walnąć lub "
"przebrnąć przez pobliski terminal płatniczy."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "smashed diesel pump"
msgstr "rozbity dystrybutor diesla"

#. ~ Description of terrain "smashed diesel pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"You're not getting any diesel out of this pump any time soon.  Some "
"barbarian decided to take their frustration out on it."
msgstr ""
"W najbliższym czasie nie dostaniesz z tej pompy żadnego oleju napędowego. "
"Jakiś barbarzyńca postanowił wyładować na niej swoją frustrację."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "JP8 pump"
msgstr "pompa JP-8"

#. ~ Description of terrain "JP8 pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This pump is filled with JP8.  If this gas dispenser doesn't give up the "
"goods for free, you may have to pay at a nearby terminal."
msgstr ""
"Ta pompa jest wypełniona JP-8. Jeśli ten dystrybutor nie wyda ci towaru za "
"darmo, być może będziesz musiał zapłacić w pobliskim terminalu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "smashed JP8 pump"
msgstr "rozbity dystrybutor JP-8"

#. ~ Description of terrain "smashed JP8 pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"You're not getting any JP8 out of this pump any time soon.  Some barbarian "
"decided to take their frustration out on it."
msgstr ""
"W najbliższym czasie nie dostaniesz z tej pompy żadnego JP-8. Jakiś "
"barbarzyńca postanowił wyładować na niej swoją frustrację."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "avgas pump"
msgstr "dystrybutor paliwa lotniczego"

#. ~ Description of terrain "avgas pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This pump is filled with avgas.  If this gas dispenser doesn't give up the "
"goods for free, you may have to pay at a nearby terminal."
msgstr ""
"Ta pompa jest wypełniona paliwem lotniczym. Jeśli ten dystrybutor nie wyda "
"ci towaru za darmo, być może będziesz musiał zapłacić w pobliskim terminalu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "smashed avgas pump"
msgstr "rozbity dystrybutor paliwa lotniczego"

#. ~ Description of terrain "smashed avgas pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"You're not getting any avgas out of this pump any time soon.  Some barbarian"
" decided to take their frustration out on it."
msgstr ""
"W najbliższym czasie nie dostaniesz z tej pompy żadnego paliwa lotniczego. "
"Jakiś barbarzyńca postanowił wyładować na niej swoją frustrację."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "ATM"
msgstr "bankomat"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ATM"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"For your banking convenience, this Automated Teller Machine is fully capable"
" of operating autonomously in the event of complete network failure.  You "
"can deposit funds from cash cards and migrate all of your inflation-adjusted"
" earnings to a single card.  These things have seen better days.  There's "
"been a run on the bank, and this machine has the dents and cracks to prove "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Dla twojego komfortu bankowego, ten automatyczny bankomat jest w pełni "
"zdolny do autonomicznego działania w przypadku całkowitej awarii sieci. "
"Możesz wpłacać środki z kart gotówkowych i przenosić wszystkie swoje zarobki"
" skorygowane o inflację na jedną kartę. Te maszyny widziały już lepsze dni. "
"Na bank był nalot, a to urządzenie ma wgniecenia i pęknięcia, aby to "
"udowodnić."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "ticket vendor"
msgstr "biletomat"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ticket vendor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This machine has a little screen, and slots intended to take your money and "
"provide you with a ticket."
msgstr ""
"Ta maszyna ma mały ekran, i szczeliny przeznaczone do przyjmowania pieniędzy"
" i wydania ci biletu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "ticket machine"
msgstr "bileter"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ticket machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This machine will provide you access to whatever is beyond it - for the "
"price of a ticket, of course."
msgstr ""
"Ta maszyna zapewni ci dostęp do wszystkiego, co znajduje się poza nią - "
"oczywiście za cenę biletu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "ventilation shutters"
msgstr "rolety wentylacyjne"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ventilation shutters"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A large wall mounted panel, covered fragile metal sheets that regulate "
"airflow."
msgstr ""
"Duży panel zamontowany na ścianie, pokryty delikatną blachą, która reguluje "
"przepływ powietrza."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "missile"
msgstr "rakieta"

#. ~ Description of terrain "missile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This is a section of an ICBM, an Intercontinental Ballistic Missile.  This "
"isn't the kind of rocket that goes to the moon."
msgstr ""
"To fragment balistycznej rakiety międzykontynentalnej. To nie jest taki "
"rodzaj rakiety, która leci na księżyc."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "blown-out missile"
msgstr "wypalona rakieta"

#. ~ Description of terrain "blown-out missile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This is a section of an ICBM, an Intercontinental Ballistic Missile.  This "
"isn't the kind of rocket that's going anywhere."
msgstr ""
"To fragment balistycznej rakiety międzykontynentalnej. To nie jest taki "
"rodzaj rakiety, która leci na księżyc."

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_radio"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_helipad_radio"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_lightindustry_00_radio"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_lightindustry_10_radio"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_outpost_cross_radio"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_outpost_normal_radio"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmh_2_radio_tower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_commercial.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_common.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_helipad/recipe_modular_helipad_common.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_lightindustry/recipe_modular_lightindustry_00.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_lightindustry/recipe_modular_lightindustry_10.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_outpost/recipe_modular_outpost_cross.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_outpost/recipe_modular_outpost_normal.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/recipe_modular_hub/version_2/recipe_modular_field_common.json
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "radio tower"
msgstr "wieża radiowa"

#. ~ Description of terrain "radio tower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "This is the structure of a radio transmission tower."
msgstr "Jest to konstrukcja radiowej wieży transmisyjnej."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "radio controls"
msgstr "sterowanie radiowe"

#. ~ Description of terrain "radio controls"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This console appears to control a nearby radio transmission tower.  It "
"doesn't seem to be fully operational."
msgstr ""
"Wygląda na to, że ta konsola kontroluje pobliską wieżę radiową. Nie wydaje "
"się być w pełni sprawna."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "high gauge pipe"
msgstr "rura wysokiej średnicy"

#. ~ Description of terrain "high gauge pipe"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "This is a section of high gauge pipe."
msgstr "Jest to odcinek rury o dużej średnicy."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "high gauge pump"
msgstr "pompa wysokiej średnicy"

#. ~ Description of terrain "high gauge pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This unpowered pump previously would have moved fluids around in a hurry."
msgstr ""
"Ta pozbawiona zasilania pompa mogła wcześniej szybko przemieszczać płyny."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "CVD machine"
msgstr "maszyna CVD"

#. ~ Description of terrain "CVD machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"The bulk of a highly technical-looking apparatus controlled by a nearby "
"console."
msgstr ""
"Bryła wyglądającej bardzo specjalistycznie aparatury sterowanej przez "
"pobliską konsolę."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "CVD control panel"
msgstr "panel kontrolny CVD"

#. ~ Description of terrain "CVD control panel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"This is a VERY expensive-looking apparatus that's labeled 'Chemical Vapor "
"Deposition Machine'.  With the input of certain exceptionally rare chemicals"
" and elements, one could conceivably coat one's weapon with diamond.  While "
"the process is extremely complicated, a previous user has helpfully "
"sketched: Hydrogen + charcoal = smiley face."
msgstr ""
"To urządzenie wygląda na BARDZO drogie i jest oznaczone jako „Maszyna do "
"chemicznego osadzania z fazy gazowej”. Za pomocą pewnych wyjątkowo rzadkich "
"substancji chemicznych i pierwiastków można prawdopodobnie pokryć broń "
"diamentem. Chociaż proces jest niezwykle skomplikowany, poprzedni użytkownik"
" pomógł nam go naszkicować: Wodór + węgiel drzewny = uśmiechnięta buźka."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "nanofabricator"
msgstr "nanofabrykator"

#. ~ Description of terrain "nanofabricator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A great column of advanced machinery.  Within this self-contained, "
"miniaturized factory, several 3D printers work in tandem with a robotic "
"assembler to manufacture nearly any inorganic object."
msgstr ""
"Wielka kolumna zaawansowanej technologii. Wewnątrz tej zamkniętej, "
"zminiaturyzowanej fabryki, kilka drukarek 3D pracuje w parze z "
"zrobotyzowanym asemblerem by produkować niemal każdy nieorganiczny obiekt."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_manufactured.json
msgid "nanofabricator control panel"
msgstr "panel kontrolny nanofabrykatora"

#. ~ Description of terrain "nanofabricator control panel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A small computer panel attached to a nanofabricator.  It has a single slot "
"for reading templates."
msgstr ""
"Mały panel komputerowy przyłączony do nanofabrykatora. Posiada pojedynczy "
"slot do odczytu szablonów."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "cloning vat"
msgstr "kadź do klonowania"

#. ~ Description of terrain "cloning vat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A vat full of solution, probably intended to hold growing clones of people "
"or other life forms."
msgstr ""
"Kadź pełna roztworu, prawdopodobnie przeznaczona do przechowywania rosnących"
" klonów ludzi lub innych form życia."

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "cloning vat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "plunk."
msgstr "plunk."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "slot machine"
msgstr "jednoręki bandyta"

#. ~ Description of terrain "slot machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A machine with a bright screen flashing hypnotic promises of wealth.  If "
"gambling with your life on a daily basis isn't enough for you, you can also "
"gamble with this."
msgstr ""
"Maszyna z jasnym ekranem, na którym migają hipnotyzujące obietnice bogactwa."
" Jeśli codzienne igranie z życiem to dla ciebie za mało, możesz grać również"
" na niej."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "water pump"
msgstr "pompa wodna"

#. ~ Description of terrain "water pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Deep well collecting ground water.  Installed water pump allows to draw "
"water from it."
msgstr ""
"Głęboka studnia gromadząca wody gruntowe. Zainstalowana pompa wodna pozwala "
"czerpać z niej wodę."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "wooden well"
msgstr "drewniana studnia"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden well"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Deep well collecting ground water.  A wooden frame with a rope and bucket "
"allows to draw water from it, with some elbow grease."
msgstr ""
"Studnia głębinowa gromadząca wodę gruntową. Drewniana rama z liną i wiadrem "
"pozwala czerpać z niej wodę przy odrobinie wysiłku."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "salt water pump"
msgstr "pompa słonej wody"

#. ~ Description of terrain "salt water pump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A water pump connected to a pipe supplying it with salt water.  Not useful "
"to drink, but it has other usages."
msgstr ""
"Pompa wodna podłączona do rury zasilającej ją w słoną wodę. Nie nadaje się "
"do picia, ale ma inne zastosowania."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "water dispenser"
msgstr "dystrybutor wody"

#. ~ Description of terrain "water dispenser"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A machine with several taps that dispenses clean water."
msgstr "Urządzenie z kilkoma kranami, wydające czystą wodę."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "telecom cabinet"
msgstr "szafa łączności"

#. ~ Description of terrain "telecom cabinet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A cabinet full of telecoms equipment.  With the lines down, you might be "
"able to take it apart for its useful electronics."
msgstr ""
"Szafa pełna sprzętu telekomunikacyjnego. Przy wyłączonych liniach, możesz "
"być w stanie rozebrać ją na części w poszukiwaniu użytecznej elektroniki."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "damaged telecom cabinet"
msgstr "uszkodzona szafa łączności"

#. ~ Description of terrain "damaged telecom cabinet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A damaged telecoms cabinet.  Might still be able to salvage some useful "
"electronics scrap from it."
msgstr ""
"Uszkodzona szafa telekomunikacyjna. Może jeszcze uda się z niej wyłowić "
"trochę przydatnego złomu elektronicznego."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "HV oil circuit breaker"
msgstr "olejowy wyłącznik obwodu wysokich napięć"

#. ~ Description of terrain "HV oil circuit breaker"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A circuit breaker that uses oil in its arc suppression chamber."
msgstr "Wyłącznik, który wykorzystuje olej w swojej komorze tłumienia łuku."

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "HV oil circuit breaker"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "small HV oil circuit breaker"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "pow!"
msgstr "puf!"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "small HV oil circuit breaker"
msgstr "mały olejowy wyłącznik obwodu wysokich napięć"

#. ~ Description of terrain "small HV oil circuit breaker"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A small circuit breaker that uses oil in its arc suppression chamber."
msgstr ""
"Mały wyłącznik, który wykorzystuje olej w swojej komorze tłumienia łuku."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "large switchgear"
msgstr "duża rozdzielnica elektryczna"

#. ~ Description of terrain "large switchgear"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A switchgear panel.  It's covered in breaker switches, fuses, and gauges."
msgstr ""
"Tablica rozdzielcza. Jest pokryta wyłącznikami, bezpiecznikami i "
"wskaźnikami."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "small switchgear"
msgstr "mała rozdzielnica elektryczna"

#. ~ Description of terrain "small switchgear"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A small switchgear panel.  It's covered in breaker switches, fuses, and "
"gauges."
msgstr ""
"Mała tablica rozdzielcza. Jest pokryta wyłącznikami, bezpiecznikami i "
"wskaźnikami."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "lightning arrester"
msgstr "ogranicznik przepięć"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lightning arrester"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A component designed to protect insulation and conductors in an electrical "
"system by directing lightning through itself and into the ground."
msgstr ""
"Element przeznaczony do ochrony izolacji i przewodów w systemie elektrycznym"
" poprzez kierowanie piorunów przez siebie i do ziemi."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "disconnect switch"
msgstr "wyłącznik główny"

#. ~ Description of terrain "disconnect switch"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A switch used to make sure an electrical system doesn't have any current "
"flowing through it, for maintenance periods."
msgstr ""
"Wyłącznik używany do upewnienia się, że przez system elektryczny nie płynie "
"żaden prąd, na czas konserwacji."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "current transformer"
msgstr "transformator prądowy"

#. ~ Description of terrain "current transformer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "An electronic component used to transform the voltage of a current."
msgstr "Element elektroniczny służący do przekształcania napięcia prądu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "potential transformer"
msgstr "transformator potencjału"

#. ~ Description of terrain "potential transformer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A specialized type of electrical transformer, "
msgstr "Wyspecjalizowany transformator elektryczny."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "conveyor belt"
msgstr "pas transmisyjny"

#. ~ Description of terrain "conveyor belt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A conveyor belt.  Used to transport things."
msgstr "Pas transmisyjny. Służy do transportu rzeczy."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "milking machine"
msgstr "maszyna dojarska"

#. ~ Description of terrain "milking machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A machine used in the dairy industry to milk cows."
msgstr "Maszyna używana w hodowli bydła do dojenia krów."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "bulk tank"
msgstr "cysterna"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bulk tank"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A heavy, high capacity tank."
msgstr "Ciężki zbiornik dużej pojemności."

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_helipad_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_lighthouse_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_lightindustry_00_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_lightindustry_10_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_outpost_cross_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_outpost_normal_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_radio_tower_root_cellar"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmh_2_root_cellar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_common.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_helipad/recipe_modular_helipad_common.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_lighthouse/recipe_modular_lighthouse_common.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_lightindustry/recipe_modular_lightindustry_00.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_lightindustry/recipe_modular_lightindustry_10.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_outpost/recipe_modular_outpost_cross.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_outpost/recipe_modular_outpost_normal.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_radio_tower/recipe_modular_radio_tower_common.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/recipe_modular_hub/version_2/recipe_modular_field_common.json
msgid "root cellar"
msgstr "ziemianka"

#. ~ Description of terrain "root cellar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "A cellar dug into the earth for storing food in a cool environment."
msgstr ""
"Ziemianka wkopana w ziemię do przechowywania żywności w chłodnej "
"temperaturze."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "covered well"
msgstr "zasłonięta sciana"

#. ~ Description of terrain "covered well"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Deep well collecting ground water.  Requires a method to draw water from."
msgstr ""
"Głęboka studnia gromadząca wody gruntowe. Potrzebuje sposobu na czerpanie z "
"niej wody."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "covered salt water well"
msgstr "osłonięta pompa słonej wody"

#. ~ Description of terrain "covered salt water well"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Deep well collecting water from a surrounding swamp.  Requires a method to "
"draw water from."
msgstr ""
"Głęboka studnia gromadząca wodę z otaczającego bagna. Potrzebuje sposobu na "
"czerpanie z niej wody."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "pit filled with straw"
msgstr "dół wypełniony słomą"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pit filled with straw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A shallow pit filled with some straw.  Very crude.  Itchy and uncomfortable "
"but better than the bare ground."
msgstr ""
"Płytki dół wypełniony słomą. Bardzo prymitywny. Swędzące i niewygodne, ale "
"lepsze to niż goła ziemia."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "improvised shelter"
msgstr "improwizowane schronienie"

#. ~ Description of terrain "improvised shelter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Improvised shelter providing little bit of protection, that can be used to "
"take refuge from the elements or to protect a campfire from the rain."
msgstr ""
"Improwizowane schronienie zapewniające odrobinę ochrony, które może być "
"użyte do schronienia się przed żywiołami lub do ochrony ogniska przed "
"deszczem."

#. ~ Description of terrain "improvised shelter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Improvised shelter which has been made a bit more comfortable by filling it "
"with dry plant matter, which should provide some more insulation.  Trying to"
" contain a fire here would be a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Zaimprowizowane schronienie, które stało się nieco wygodniejsze dzięki "
"wypełnieniu go suchą materią roślinną, co powinno zapewnić nieco więcej "
"izolacji. Próba opanowania ognia w tym miejscu byłaby złym pomysłem."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "pine lean-to"
msgstr "schronienie z gałęzi"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pine lean-to"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A small shelter roofed with pine leaves, that can be used to take refuge "
"from the elements or to protect a campfire from the rain."
msgstr ""
"Schronienie zadaszone igliwiem sosnowym, które może służyć do schronienia "
"się przed żywiołem lub do ochrony ogniska przed deszczem."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "tarp lean-to"
msgstr "schronienie z plandeki"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tarp lean-to"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A small shelter covered by waterproof tarp, that can be used to take refuge "
"from the elements or to protect a campfire from the rain."
msgstr ""
"Schronienie przykryte nieprzemakalną plandeką, które może służyć do ochrony "
"przed warunkami atmosferycznymi lub do ochrony ogniska przed deszczem."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "standing propane tank"
msgstr "stojąca butla propanu"

#. ~ Description of furniture "standing propane tank"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"A huge metal tank that can be used to safely store large amounts of propane."
msgstr ""
"Ogromny metalowy zbiornik, który może być użyty do bezpiecznego "
"przechowywania dużej ilości propanu."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "mechanical winch"
msgstr "mechaniczna dźwignia"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mechanical winch"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This is a gate control winch.  If it's functioning, it can be used to open "
"or close a nearby gate or door."
msgstr ""
"Jest to wciągarka sterująca bramą. Jeśli działa, może być użyta do otwarcia "
"lub zamknięcia pobliskiej bramy lub drzwi."

#. ~ Description of terrain "mechanical winch"
#. ~ Description of terrain "control lever"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This is a gate control winch.  If it's functioning, it can be used to open "
"or close a nearby gate."
msgstr ""
"Jest to wciągarka sterująca bramą. Jeśli działa, może być użyta do otwarcia "
"lub zamknięcia pobliskiej bramy."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "control lever"
msgstr "dźwignia kontrolujaca"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "barn door pulley"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "barn door pulley"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "A system of ropes and pulleys that allows to pull up heavy doors."
msgstr "System lin i wielokrążków pozwalający unieść ciężkie drzwi."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "gate pulley"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "gate pulley"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"A system of ropes and pulleys that allows to pull up heavy doors or gates."
msgstr "System lin i wielokrążków pozwalający unieść ciężkie drzwi lub bramy."

#. ~ Description of terrain "gate pulley"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"A system of ropes and wooden pulleys that allows to pull up heavy doors or "
"gates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "intercom"
msgstr "interkom"

#. ~ Description of terrain "intercom"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"An intercom panel.  For when you want to scare the crap out of someone, or "
"just talk to them over the intercom system, if you're boring like that."
msgstr ""
"Panel interkomu. Kiedy chcesz kogoś nastraszyć, albo po prostu pogadać z nim"
" przez interkom, jeśli jesteś nudziarzem."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "card reader"
msgstr "czytnik kart"

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom inside"
" a flask that is universally known to indicate SCIENCE.  An ominous red LED "
"reminds you of a robot gone haywire from an old sci-fi flick.  You could "
"swipe a scientific ID badge near it if you do not fear the machine."
msgstr ""
"To jest czytnik kart elektronicznych. Widnieje na nim stylizowany symbol "
"atomu w kolbie, który jest powszechnie znany jako symbol NAUKI. Złowieszcza "
"czerwona dioda LED przypomina robota, który oszalał w starym filmie sci-fi. "
"Jeśli nie boisz się tej maszyny, możesz przeciągnąć po niej identyfikatorem "
"naukowym."

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom inside"
" a flask that is universally known to indicate SCIENCE.  The stark red LED "
"blinks askance at your geek cred.  You could swipe a scientific ID badge "
"near it to unlock the gates to discovery."
msgstr ""
"To jest czytnik kart elektronicznych. Przedstawia stylizowany symbol atomu w"
" kolbie, który jest powszechnie znany jako znak NAUKI. Jaskrawa czerwona "
"dioda LED mruga pytająco na widok twojego kujońskiego wizerunku. Możesz "
"przeciągnąć po nim identyfikatorem naukowym, aby odblokować wrota do odkryć."

#. ~ Query message of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "Swipe your ID card?"
msgstr "Przeciągnąć twoją kartę identyfikacyjną?"

#. ~ Success message of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"You insert your ID card.\n"
"<color_light_green>The nearby doors unlock.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Redundant message of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "The nearby doors are already opened."
msgstr "Pobliskie drzwi są już otwarte."

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  The universal symbol of an eagle driving a "
"tank, biting a grenade pin stands rampant in front of an American flag.  A "
"small, red LED remains constant, as if watching you, waiting.  You could "
"swipe a military ID card in front of the reader if you dared."
msgstr ""
"To jest czytnik kart elektronicznych. Uniwersalny symbol orła jadącego na "
"czołgu, gryzącego zawleczkę granatu, wyrasta na tle amerykańskiej flagi. "
"Mała, czerwona dioda LED nie przestaje świecić, jakby cię obserwowała, "
"czekała. Gdyby się odważyć, można by przeciągnąć po nim wojskową kartę "
"identyfikacyjną."

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  The symbol of a gear in front of a bulging "
"bicep is emblazoned on the matte black surface with an illegible heavy "
"industrial company title.  A red LED blinks on the card reader.  Perhaps an "
"industrial ID card could still open it."
msgstr ""
"To jest czytnik kart elektronicznych. Na czarnej matowej powierzchni wyryty "
"jest symbol koła zębatego przed wybrzuszonym bicepsem oraz nieczytelna nazwa"
" firmy z branży przemysłu ciężkiego. Na czytniku mruga czerwona dioda. Być "
"może przemysłowa karta identyfikacyjna wciąż mogłaby go otworzyć."

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This looks like the console controlling the security door, there's a pretty "
"big reading surface on it.  You can see \"Fp\" soberly printed above the "
"reader.  You have no idea what could open it."
msgstr ""
"To wygląda jak konsola sterująca drzwiami bezpieczeństwa, jest na niej "
"całkiem spora powierzchnia do odczytu. Nad czytnikiem widać trzeźwo wypisane"
" „Fp”. Nie masz pojęcia, co może go otworzyć."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "Facility entrance card reader"
msgstr "Czytnik kart wejściowych do obiektu"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Facility entrance card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom inside"
" a flask that is universally known to indicate SCIENCE.  You could swipe a "
"Visitor's Pass near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr ""
"To jest czytnik kart elektronicznych. Widnieje na nim stylizowany symbol "
"atomu w kolbie, który jest powszechnie znany jako symbol NAUKI. Można po nim"
" przeciągnąć kartę gościa, aby odblokować bramę."

