#. ~ Query message of terrain "Maintenance: blue zone card reader"
#. ~ Query message of terrain "Security: yellow zone card reader"
#. ~ Query message of terrain "Security: magenta zone card reader"
#. ~ Query message of terrain "Security: black zone card reader"
