".40 S&W.  Someone was down on their luck when they hand-reloaded this one - "
"it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  Expect lower "
"velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"Pełnopłaszczowa amunicja 10 mm Auto z kulami 180 gr. Nabój 10 mm Auto to "
"dość mocny nabój do broni krótkiej i protoplasta bardziej popularnego "
