#. ~ Description of "back holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather holster, big enough for a rifle or other large gun.  Designed to "
"be strapped to the back.  Whilst initially cumbersome, it becomes much "
"easier to use with practice.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
