msgstr[1] "Marlin 39A"
msgstr[2] "Marlin 39A"
msgstr[3] "Marlin 39A"

#. ~ Description of gun "Marlin 39A"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The oldest and longest-produced shoulder firearm in the world.  Though it "
"fires the weak .22 round, it is highly accurate and damaging, and has "
"essentially no recoil."
msgstr ""
"Najstarsza i najdłużej produkowana naramienna broń palna na świecie. Choć "
"strzela słabym nabojem .22, to jest bardzo celna i raniąca i niemal nie ma "
"odrzutu."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
