#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The first gun produced by O.F. Mossberg & Sons, the Brownie is a small "
"pocket pistol marketed to trappers during the early 20th century.  Its four "
"barrels can accept .22 Short and .22 LR cartridges."
msgstr ""

