#. ~ Description of gun "S&W 22A"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A popular .22 pistol from Smith & Wesson.  It's quite light for its size, "
"and an integrated rail makes it easy to mount optics to the gun."
msgstr ""

