msgid "M202A1 FLASH"
msgid_plural "M202A1 FLASH"
msgstr[0] "M202A1 FLASH"
msgstr[1] "M202A1 FLASH"
msgstr[2] "M202A1 FLASH"
msgstr[3] "M202A1 FLASH"

#. ~ Description of gun "M202A1 FLASH"
#: data/json/items/gun/66mm.json
msgid ""
"An American rocket launcher designed in the 1970s to replace WWII-era "
"flamethrowers still in use in Vietnam.  It has four barrels sharing the 66mm"
" caliber of the M72 LAW."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M202A1 FLASH"
