#. ~ Only one third (410 g) of a whole pipe is being used
#. ~ Description of "pipebomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a section of a pipe filled with explosives.  Use this item to light "
"the fuse, which gives you six seconds to get away from it before it "
"detonates.  You'll need a lighter or some matches to use it."
msgstr ""
"To odcinek rury napełniony materiałem wybuchowym. Użyj, by odpalić lont, co "
"da ci sześć sekund, by od niej uciec zanim wybuchnie. Potrzebujesz "
"zapalniczki lub zapałek, by to zrobić."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pipebomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
