msgid "Adds trait for badge check."
msgstr "Dodaje cechę dla weryfikacji odznaki."

#. ~ Message of spell "Green Maintenance Badge Trait"
#. ~ Message of spell "Ocher Maintenance Badge Trait"
#. ~ Message of spell "Blue Maintenance Badge Trait"
#. ~ Message of spell "Light Green Researcher Badge Trait"
#. ~ Message of spell "Black Security Badge Trait"
