#. ~ Description of monster "shorthair cat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small domesticated predator gone feral in the absence of human "
"stewardship.  Harried by the elements and the rigors of survival, it is "
"scruffy and skittish."
msgstr ""
"Mały udomowiony drapieżnik zdziczały pod nieobecność ludzkiego "
"przewodnictwa. Niesiony żywiołem i rygorem przetrwania, jest cały brudny i "
"obszarpany."

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_cat_isherwood"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small domesticated predator gone feral in the absence of human "
"stewardship.  Located near the old Isherwood cabin."
msgstr ""

