msgid "Can't wait for this summer to be over."
msgstr "Nie mogę się doczekać aż to lato się skończy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Kinda wishing it would cool off a bit, to be honest."
msgstr "Po prawdzie to trochę czekam aż się nieco ochłodzi."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK, maybe it'll stop me from freezing in this weather."
msgstr "Ok, może to pozwoli mi nie zamarznąć w tą pogodę."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Gotta say, I'm not minding the snow."
msgstr "Muszę powiedzieć, że śnieg mi wcale nie przeszkadza."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Not quite like the winters from before, huh?"
msgstr "Nie to samo jak te zimy zanim się zadziało, co?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Can't wait for this winter to be over."
msgstr "Nie mogę się doczekać aż ta zima się skończy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "It's weird the zombies don't freeze."
msgstr "Dziwne, że zombie nie zamarzają."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "A nice chat might improve my health somewhat."
msgstr "Miła pogawędka może wyjdzie mi na zdrowie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, but I'm feeling a bit under the weather."
msgstr "Jasne, ale czuję się troche pod psem."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm not feeling too well, but I can still talk for a bit."
msgstr "Nie najlepiej się czuję, ale chwilę porozmawiajmy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "We can talk, even though I'm not feeling too well."
msgstr "Możemy porozmawiać, chociaż nie czuję się najlepiej."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Well, I'm feeling pretty sick… but sure."
msgstr "Cóż, jestem chory… ale niech będzie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
msgstr "<thoughtfulchitchat>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I need a break anyway, how are you?"
msgstr "I tak potrzebuję chwili relaksu, jak się masz?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how's it going?"
msgstr "No więc, jak leci?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's shoot the shit!  You OK, <name_g>?"
msgstr "Ustrzelmy gówno! Wszystko OK, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm OK with that, what's up?"
msgstr "Mi pasuje, co nowego?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I guess I can spare a few minutes, how's things?"
msgstr "Kilka minut mi nie zaszkodzi, jak się miewasz?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sure thing <name_g>, you good?"
msgstr "Jasna sprawa <name_g>, wszystko w porząsiu?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, you got something to get off your chest?"
msgstr "Pewnie, leży ci coś na sercu?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Always ready for a good chat!  But why, you OK?"
msgstr "Zawsze gotów na dobrą pogawędkę! Ale co tam, wszystko ok?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK <name_g>, how are you coping?"
msgstr "OK <name_g>, jak sobie radzisz?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm game.  How you holding up?"
msgstr "Wszystko gra. Jak się trzymasz?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's forget the world for a while.  How you doin'?"
msgstr "Zapomnijmy na chwilę o świecie. Jak się miewasz?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What the heck.  How's life been treating you?"
msgstr "A co mi tam. Jak tam życie?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how about that weather, eh?"
msgstr "No więc, jak tam pogoda, co?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Nice of you to make time.  How's it been for you lately?"
msgstr ""
"Miło z twojej strony że znalazłeś czas. Jak tam sprawy u ciebie ostatnio?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "My dogs've been barkin' lately, you know?"
msgstr "A wiesz, mój pies ostatnio głośno szczeka."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I feel great today.  Not sure what it is, just one of those days."
msgstr "Świetnie się dziś czuję. Tak bez powodu, chyba taki dzień."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I just can't believe it's over.  I keep running my head back to the days it "
"all fell apart.  The riots.  The lies.  The psychos.  It never really felt "
"like it was going to go like this."
msgstr ""
"Nie mogę uwierzyć, że to koniec. Ciągle wracam w myślach do dni jak to się "
"wszystko rozsypało. Zamieszki. Kłamstwa. Psychopaci. Nic nie zapowiadało, że"
" to się tak potoczy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think there's any truth to the crap they were spouting before the "
"world ended?  Mind control drugs in the water, bio-terrorism?  Some of it "
"would make sense, but it seems so far-fetched.  Then again, we're dealing "
"with actual zombies."
msgstr ""
"Myślisz, że jest jakaś prawda w tych bzdurach, które opowiadali przed końcem"
" świata? Leki kontrolujące umysł w wodzie, bio-terroryzm? Niektóre z nich "
"miałyby sens, ale wydają się tak bardzo przesadzone. Z drugiej strony, mamy "
"do czynienia z prawdziwymi zombie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if I should be getting more religious now, or less.  You know what "
"I'm sayin', <name_g>?"
msgstr ""
"Zastanawiam się, czy powinienem być teraz bardziej religijny, czy mniej. "
"Wiesz, o czym mówię, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin' about rearranging my gear.  It's a real mess.  Don't wanna "
"go for my weapon and accidentally pull out a granola bar, right?"
msgstr ""
"Zastanawiałem się nad uporządkowaniem mojego sprzętu. Mam tu niezły bałagan."
" Nie chcę sięgnąć po broń i przypadkowo wyciągnąć batonika zbożowego, "
"prawda?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why we even bother?  We're all just gonna be zombies "
"eventually anyway.  I mean, not that I'm gonna stop fighting, but what's the"
" damn point?"
msgstr ""
"Zastanawiałeś się kiedyś, po co w ogóle zawracamy sobie głowę? W końcu i tak"
" wszyscy staniemy się zombie. To znaczy, nie żebym miał przestać walczyć, "
"ale jaki to ma sens?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wish I could go bust a cap in one of those zombies right now, without all "
"the fuss about being scared for my life."
msgstr ""
"Chciałbym móc pójść rozwalić łeb któremuś z tych zombie już teraz, bez tego "
"całego zamartwiania się o swoje życie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Every time I close my eyes, I can still see the riots.  Do you get that, or "
"is it just me?"
msgstr ""
"Za każdym razem, gdy zamykam oczy, widzę te zamieszki. Wiesz o co mi chodzi,"
" czy tylko ja tak mam?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole time before <the_cataclysm> was just a dream "
"you're waking up from?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"When do you think you realized the world was ending?  For me, it was that "
"damned YouTube video with the lady killing the baby.  Holy shit, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Jak myślisz, kiedy zdałeś sobie sprawę, że świat się kończy? Dla mnie to był"
" ten przeklęty filmik na YouTube z kobietą zabijającą dziecko. Jasna "
"cholera, czaisz?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I wonder if the government's still out there, holed up in some bunker."
msgstr "Zastanawiam się, czy rząd nadal tam jest, zaszyty w jakimś bunkrze."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember some of the crazy news from the end of the world?  The stuff that "
"got drowned out by the riot coverage I mean.  Like, didn't the governor of "
"Rhode Island secede from the Union or something?"
msgstr ""
"Pamiętasz niektóre z szalonych wiadomości z końca świata? Sprawy zagłuszone "
"przez relację z zamieszek. Na przykład, czy przypadkiem gubernator Rhode "
"Island nie odłączył się aby od Unii?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep having dreams that zombies still remember who they were as people, "
"and are just trapped inside the bodies watching everything happen.  Haven't "
"been sleeping well."
msgstr ""
"Ciągle mam sny, w których zombie wciąż pamiętają, kim byli jako ludzie, i są"
" po prostu uwięzieni w ciałach, obserwując wszystko, co się dzieje. Nie "
"sypiam zbyt dobrze."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Those mind-control drugs they put in the water to make people riot… you "
"think they're still in there?"
msgstr ""
"Te środki kontrolujące umysł, które dodawali do wody, żeby ludzie się "
"buntowali… Myślisz, że wciąż tam są?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't stop wondering who fucked up to make all this happen.  Obviously we "
"can't trust the news, they claimed the zombies were \"rioters\" for weeks.  "
"Why?  Where did this come from?"
msgstr ""
"Nie mogę przestać się zastanawiać, kto spierdolił i doprowadził do tego "
"wszystkiego. Oczywiście nie możemy ufać wiadomościom, przez całe tygodnie "
"twierdzili, że zombie to „buntownicy”. Dlaczego? Skąd to się wzięło?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"If what they told us about the Chinese was even partly true, do you think "
"it's like this in China?  Or maybe the US is some kind of quarantine zone, "
"and at least some of the world is still out there."
msgstr ""
"Jeśli to, co mówili nam o Chińczykach było choć w części prawdą, to myślisz,"
" że w Chinach jest podobnie? A może USA to jakaś strefa kwarantanny i "
"przynajmniej część świata nadal tam jest."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Have you noticed injuries aren't healing the same as usual?  I started "
"spotting it before the world ended, but it's become more pronounced.  "
"There's hardly even a granulation step after a cut closes."
msgstr ""
"Czy zauważyłeś, że rany nie goją się tak samo jak zwykle? Zacząłem to "
"dostrzegać jeszcze przed końcem świata, ale teraz jest to jeszcze bardziej "
"zauważalne. Po zasklepieniu się rany niemal nie ma już nawet etapu "
"ziarninowania."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I still don't understand how these zombies are powered.  They're like "
"perpetual motion machines."
msgstr "Wciąż nie rozumiem, co napędza te zombie. Są jak perpetuum mobile."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"So many parts of this still don't fit together.  Who created the zombies?  "
"What powers them?  Maybe the rumors of mind control drugs were true all "
"along, and someone found a way to bioengineer living dead."
msgstr ""
"Tak wiele części tego wszystkiego nadal do siebie nie pasuje. Kto stworzył "
"zombie? Co je napędza? Może pogłoski o lekach kontrolujących umysł były "
"prawdziwe, a ktoś znalazł sposób na bioinżynierię żywych trupów."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "<neutralchitchat>"
msgstr "<neutralchitchat>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"How do these zombies even keep going?  What are they eating?  Do you think "
"they'll ever rot away?"
msgstr ""
"Jak te zombie w ogóle się trzymają? Co one jedzą? Czy myślisz, że "
"kiedykolwiek zgniją?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin', one of these days, we're gonna run out of toilet paper.  "
"What then?"
msgstr ""
"Tak sobie pomyślałem, że pewnego dnia skończy nam się papier toaletowy. Co "
"wtedy?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think it's weird how we'll, like, open a locked building and find a "
"lone zombie inside?  How'd it even get there?"
msgstr ""
"Nie sądzisz, że to dziwne, że jak otwieramy zamknięty budynek, to znajdujemy"
" w nim samotnego zombie? Jak on się tam w ogóle dostał?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're all psychos, not just the ones that went crazy "
"and rioted.  I never would have thought I could do the things I've done "
"since the world ended."
msgstr ""
"Czasami zastanawiam się, czy wszyscy jesteśmy psycholami, nie tylko ci, "
"którzy zwariowali i wszczęli zamieszki. Nigdy bym nie pomyślał, że mogę "
"robić takie rzeczy, jakie robię od kiedy świat się skończył."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You read any good books lately?  I'm glad we still got books."
msgstr ""
"Czytałeś ostatnio jakieś dobre książki? Cieszę się, że w ogóle mamy jeszcze "
"książki."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know what I miss?  Movie theaters.  You think Hollywood survived this?  "
"Maybe there's a bunch of zombie actors out there, filmin' shit out of "
"reflex.  Hah, I'd watch that shit."
msgstr ""
"Wiesz, czego mi brakuje? Kina. Myślisz, że Hollywood to przetrwało? Może "
"jest tam banda aktorów zombie, którzy odruchowo kręcą to gówno. Hah, "
"obejrzałbym to gówno."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I hear you, <name_g>…"
msgstr "Słyszę cię, <name_g>…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That reminds me of something…"
msgstr "To mi o czym przypomniało…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Right, right.  Say, you ever thought about…"
msgstr "Jasne, jasne. Powiedz, myślałeś kiedyś o…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_girl.json
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_BR_tableofcontents_AFS.json
msgid "<BGSS_intro_question>"
msgstr "<BGSS_intro_question>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
msgid "How did you come to be a merc working for the Free Merchants, anyway?"
msgstr "Tak w ogóle, to jak zostałeś najemnikiem Wolnych Handlarzy?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
msgid "So, you got your whisky.  Tell me that story."
msgstr "No więc masz swoją whisky. Opowiedz tę historię."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I was just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather "
"was a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some american <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!  And I got my revenge, thanks to a special "
"someone."
msgstr ""
"Byłem zwykłym kucharzem od pizzy. Mój ojciec był pizzerem, mój dziadek był "
"pizzerem i ja również zostałem pizzerem. Robiłem pizzę przez całe życie, "
"dopóki jakiś <name_b> amerykanin nie zrujnował mojego biznesu! Nie mogłem "
"nic na to poradzić, ale teraz, z <the_cataclysm> i <zombies> wokół, mam "
"szansę się zemścić! I zemściłem się, dzięki pewnej wyjątkowej osobie."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "He-he, that was a fun ride, <name_g>."
msgstr "He-he, to była ostra jazda, <name_g>."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
