"FROM: Vincent Fuels, Researcher\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: This is bad!\n"
"\n"
" While you were gone last night, the old man started to wake up and become cranky.\n"
" We had to give him another dose of that elephant tranquilizer!\n"
" I think he might actually be strong enough to break out of his cell now.\n"
" We really need to do something before he kills someone!\n"
" I know this experiment meant a lot to you, but it isn't worth the risk anymore!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
