msgid ""
"Our farm could be expanded by finishing the shed and adding additional "
"plots."
msgstr ""
"Naszą farmę można rozbudować dokańczając szopę i dodając kolejne poletka."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_farm_3"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_farm/version_1/recipe_primitive_farm.json
