"Building a processing shack should allow us to reclaim additional seeds from"
" our byproducts."
msgstr ""
"Budowa chaty do przetwarzania plonów pozwoli nam odzyskać więcej ziarna z "
"produktów ubocznych."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_farm_4"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_farm/version_1/recipe_primitive_farm.json
