#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's install a bellows for our forge and add some more tools.  This will "
"extend our recipe repertoire."
msgstr ""
"Zainstalujmy miechy do naszej kuźni i dodajmy kilka dodatkowych narzędzi. To"
" rozszerzy nasz repertuar przepisów."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_6"
