#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_salt_water_pipe.json
msgid ""
"Construct a pump and connect it to the salt water pipe.  You have to add the"
" pump to a storage zone to access the salt water for camp crafting!"
msgstr ""
"Zbuduj pompę i podłącz ją do rurociągów ze słoną wodą. Musisz dodać pompę do"
" strefy przechowywania, aby uzyskać dostęp do słonej wody do wytwarzania w "
"obozie!"

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_salt_water_pump"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_salt_water_pipe.json
msgid "construct a salt water pump"
msgstr "zbuduj pompę do słonej wody"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_1_wad"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_wad.json
msgid ""
"We can use a wattle-and-daub smithy.  Let's start by building a spot to "
"protect the workers from the rain."
msgstr ""
"Przyda się nam szachulcowa kuźnia. Zacznijmy od zbudowania miejsca, aby "
"ochronić pracowników przed deszczem."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_1_wad"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_wad.json
