#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A bulky flamethrower unit mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  An "
"internal compressor adds extra range and spread to the flame compared to "
"most handheld flame units."
msgstr ""

