msgid_plural "exosuit microwave cannons"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "exosuit microwave cannon"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A 'less-lethal' weapon mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  Causes a "
"painful burning sensation as water molecules are turned to high temperature "
"vapor.  Infamous for it's use by UICA forces used it to break up protests, "
"the effectiveness can be hard to predict due to variables like the moisture "
"in the air and protective layers on the target."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
