#. ~ Description of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid ""
"An offensive style centered around rapid slashes and prodding.  Each attack "
"landed increases combat ability but leaves you increasingly vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"Styl ofensywny skoncentrowany na szybkich cięciach i pchnięciach. Każdy "
"celny atak zwiększa twoje możliwości bojowe, ale pozostawia cię coraz "
"bardziej bezbronnym."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid "You prepare to whittle down your enemies."
msgstr "Przygotowujesz się do pokonania swoich wrogów."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s initiates blade-work."
msgstr "%s inicjuje pracę z ostrzem."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid "Unwavering Edge"
msgstr "Niezachwiana krawędź"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Blade-work" in martial art "Unwavering Edge"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid ""
"You attack with your blade at your opponent.\n"
"\n"
"+1 cut and stab armor penetration, -2.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"Atakujesz przeciwnika swoim ostrzem.\n"
"\n"
"+1 ciętego i kłutego przebicia pancerza, -2,0 umiejętności uniki.\n"
"Trwa 2 tury. Kumuluje się 2 razy."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid "Ruthlessness"
msgstr "Bezwzględność"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Blade-work" in martial art "Ruthlessness"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid ""
"You continue attacking with your blade furiously.\n"
"\n"
"+1 cut and stab damage, -1 dodge attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""
"W dalszym ciągu wściekle atakujesz swoim ostrzem.\n"
"\n"
"+1 obrażeń ciętych i kłutych, -1 próba uniku.\n"
"Trwa 1 trę. Kumuluje się 4 razy."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid "Rending Strikes"
msgstr "Rozdzierające ciosy"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Blade-work" in martial art "Rending Strikes"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid ""
"You slash with your blade with a vengeance.\n"
"\n"
"+2 cut and stab armor penetration, -1 dodge attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Tniesz z zemsty swoim ostrzem.\n"
"\n"
"+2 ciętego i kłutego przebicia pancerza, -1 próba uniku.\n"
"Trwa 1 turę. Kumuluje się 3 razy."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid "Calculating Eyes"
msgstr "Kalkulujące oczy"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Blade-work" in martial art "Calculating
#. Eyes"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
