msgstr "Powolny, metodyczny, mocno opancerzony. Chodzący czołg."

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Horns"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You feel your face, scalp, and neck stretch and change into something "
