msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "dagger of judgement"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
msgid ""
"A short blade made of glowing, radiant fire.  It explodes with radiance when"
" striking enemies."
