#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Slime Breath"
msgstr "Śluzowy oddech"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your breath is sticky and slimy somehow.  This won't damage your "
"interactions with people but it's definitely noticeable."
msgstr ""
"Twój oddech jest jakoś lepki i śliski. Nie zaszkodzi to twoim interakcjom z "
"ludźmi, ale na pewno jest to zauważalne."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Chimeric Breath"
msgstr "Chimeryczny oddech"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chimeric Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your breath could metaphorically melt lead.  It's horrible.  It's so bad "
"that it can actually distract from your attempts to intimidate someone."
msgstr ""
"Twój oddech może metaforycznie stopić ołów. Jest okropny. Jest tak zły, że "
"może odwrócić uwagę od twoich prób zastraszenia kogoś."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Debug Spell Mutation"
msgstr "Debug mutacja zaklęć"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Spell Mutation"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Gives all of the debug spells at max level."
msgstr "Daje wszystkie czary debugowania na maksymalnym poziomie."

