#. ~ Description of "Vampire Blood Fuel Cell Generator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"What reason could anyone have making a bionic power generator that runs off "
"the blood of vampires?  After some thought, one option that occurs to you "
"would be the possibility that by limiting the fuel options, a vampire is "
"also limiting the opportunities for a rogue minion to use its bionics "
"against its master."
msgstr ""

