#. ~ Description of MOD "Bionic Slots"
#: data/mods/cbm_slots/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Enables the bionic slots system, which limits the number of CBMs you can "
"install in each bodypart."
msgstr ""
"Wprowadza system slotów implantów bionicznych, który ogranicza liczbę KMB, "
"jakie możesz zainstalować w każdej części ciała."

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid "Dark Days of the Dead"
msgstr "Dark Days of the Dead"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Dark Days of the Dead"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Turns the game into a classic Romero zombie game.  You must destroy the "
"brain.  Getting bitten is fatal.  However, zombies don't evolve, and when "
"they're down, they're down.  Removes the sci-fi and interdimensional aspects"
" of CDDA."
msgstr ""
"Zmienia grę w klasyczną grę zombie Romero. Musisz zniszczyć mózg. Ugryzienie"
" jest śmiertelne. Jednakże, zombie nie ewoluują, a kiedy padną, to już po "
"nich. Usuwa sci-fi i międzywymiarowe aspekty CDDA."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Zombie bite"
msgstr "Ugryzienie zombie"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus_scratch"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Zombie contagion"
msgstr "Zarażenie zombie"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion, Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Everything's so dark.  You can feel it, you don't have much time left."
msgstr "Wszystko jest takie ciemne. Czujesz to, zostało ci niewiele czasu."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid ""
"The area around your zombie bite is festering and red, and you're feeling "
"hot and cold at once."
msgstr ""
"Miejsce ugryzienia przez zombie jest ropiejące i zaczerwienione, a ty "
"czujesz gorąco i zimno jednocześnie."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You've got a painful bite from a zombie.  You know how this ends."
msgstr "Masz bolesne ugryzienie od zombie. Wiesz, jak to się skończy."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You've been bitten.  It's bad."
msgstr "Ugryziono cię. To źle."

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You succumb to your zombie bite."
msgstr "Padasz od ugryzienia zombie."

