#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "High Tech, Low Life"
msgstr "Wysoka technika, niski status"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "High Tech, Low Life"
msgstr "Wysoka technika, niski status"

#. ~ Description of scenario "High Tech, Low Life" for male
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the world ended, bionics were reserved for the rich and the famous.  "
"You might not have been either, but you wanted in.  Hidden offices "
"sequestered away in basements, anesthetic smuggled out of hospitals, and "
"desperate people with little to lose could get you what you wanted.  If you "
"went too deep, however, your augmentation may have come at a price…"
msgstr ""
"Przed końcem świata bioniki były zarezerwowane dla bogatych i sławnych. Nie "
"byłeś żadnym z nich, ale chciałeś mieć swój udział. Ukryte przychodnie "
"schowane w piwnicach, anestetyki przeszmuglowane ze szpitali i zdesperowani "
"ludzie nie mający wiele do stracenia dali ci co trzeba. Jednakże, jeśli "
"zaszedłeś za daleko, twoje wszczepy mogły nie przyjść za darmo…"

#. ~ Description of scenario "High Tech, Low Life" for female
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
