msgid " WARNING: Operator missing"
msgstr " UWAGA: Brak operatora"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:5313
msgid ""
"\n"
" Using the Autodoc without an operator can lead to <color_light_cyan>serious injuries</color> or <color_light_cyan>death</color>.\n"
" By continuing with the operation you accept the risks and acknowledge that you will not take any legal actions against this facility in case of an accident. "
