msgstr "Nie masz miejsca do zasiania nasion…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1502
msgid "I'm sorry, you don't have any money to plant those seeds…"
msgstr ""
"Przykro mi, ale nie starczy ci pieniędzy na sfinansowanie siewu tych nasion…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1509
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You only have enough money to plant %d plants.  Do you wish to have %d %s "
